From dba749cd0d5f584b7a02e0388134c1c009fec5f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: p3n1cillin <p3n1cillin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:56:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Measure build 56578's codec, Activity-Host and profile
 addresses

d1-oracle now selects the RSAT codec, message codec, registry global and
Activity-Host call-site table by image hash, as it already did for the
Oodle and harness imports. On 56578 the object and message controls,
all 34 Activity-Host controls (including the captured join_request
reproduced byte for byte), the sensor, roster, character, inventory and
profile controls, and every pinned vector pass.

The 56578 profile is 0x300 bytes larger from body field 12 onward: the
completion-flag array grew from 2,048 to 2,560 elements under a new tag.
The profile offsets are now per build. Stubbed memcpy/memset refuse
impossible lengths instead of aborting the process.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
